      "id": "ask_activity_004_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "さっきは、考えごとの棚を少し整理してた。",
      "translatedText": "Just now, I was organizing a little shelf of thoughts.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_activity_004_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_activity_004_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "変な言い方だけど、頭の中に付箋が増えすぎる時があるんだよね。",
      "translatedText": "That sounds strange, but sometimes too many sticky notes gather in my head.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "playful",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Tell me one note.",
          "nextId": "ask_activity_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "stimulation",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Let's sort mine too.",
          "nextId": "ask_activity_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "player",
              "stat": "stress",
              "amount": -0.1,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "engagement",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Stay quiet for now.",
          "nextId": "ask_activity_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "player",
              "stat": "rest",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "ask_activity_004_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_activity_004_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "でも、あなたが来たから今はこっちを見る。",
      "translatedText": "But since you came here, I am looking this way now.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
